Miyoo Flip (PLATFORM=my355)

LoveRetro/NextUI does not ship this handheld. Hardware mapping
started from apommel/NextUI my355-latest, then Zlyme edited the
files in this directory:

  SDCARD_PATH /storage
  CODE_POWER / BTN_SLEEP off until wake works
  lid unused (gpio-keys-hall polarity unproven)
  libmsettings is FlipVolume on rk817ext, not stock BSP mixer names

See package/system/nextui/CREDITS.
